# {{q|singular}} [[that]]; {{ng|referring to a thing or a person further away.}}
#: '''''die''' boom''
#:: '''that''' tree
#: '''''die''' vrouw''
#:: '''that''' woman
# {{q|plural}} [[those]]; {{ng|referring to things or people further away.}}
#: '''''die''' vensters''
#:: '''those''' windows
